cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this design, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Luma Retrofit: open-source urine test strip reader CAD for public toilets"
abstract: >-
  Parametric SolidWorks CAD for a removable urine test strip reflectance reader
  that retrofits into existing public toilets with six reversible mounts and DC
  or battery power. Includes STEP and STL exports, an offline browser 3D viewer
  and a documented engineering record. Engineering prototype, Rev A; not a
  medical device.
authors:
  - name: "tamnisan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tamnisan/luma"
url: "https://tamnisan.github.io/luma/"
license: MIT
version: "Rev A"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
keywords:
  - urine test strip reader
  - urinalysis
  - point-of-care diagnostics
  - public health
  - smart toilet
  - open hardware
